<li>Valid Seaman's Book.</li>
<li>OK-to-Board Letter / Letter of Invitation issued by ISS Mexico.</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td valign="top" width="50%">
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px;">
<li>Vessel Particulars &amp; Mexican Port confirmation.</li>
<li>Confirmed Flight Itinerary &amp; Joining Instructions.</li>
<li>Qualifying Visa (Mexican / US C1-D1 / Schengen, etc.) if required.</li>
</ul>
