<p style="font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0284c7; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">4.1 On-Signers (Joining Crew)</p>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 15px; font-size: 9pt; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.5;">
<li>ISS Mexico reviews docs and issues OK-to-Board / Letter of Invitation.</li>
