<p style="font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; color: #334155; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">4.2 Off-Signers (Repatriating Crew)</p>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 15px; font-size: 9pt; color: #334155; line-height: 1.5;">
